        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
            <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
                <span class="text-brand-400 font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-3 block">Enterprise-Grade Security</span>
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Built on Trust, Secured by Engineering</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed">
                    We take your safety as seriously as your journey. Our platform is built upon professional software engineering standards to ensure your data and physical security are never compromised.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Security Feature 1 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-lg border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 mb-6 border border-emerald-500/20">
                        <i class="ph-fill ph-lock-key text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Strict HTTPS Security</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        All communication between you and our servers is encrypted using bank-grade 256-bit TLS/SSL certificates. Your payment details and personal chat data remain strictly confidential and impossible to intercept.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Security Feature 2 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-lg border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 mb-6 border border-blue-500/20">
                        <i class="ph-fill ph-shield-check text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Verified Identities</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Say goodbye to anonymous travel. Every user profile is manually and algorithmically verified using Government-issued ID (Aadhar/PAN for India), phone numbers, and strict email verification protocols.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Security Feature 3 -->
                <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-lg border border-slate-700 p-8 rounded-3xl hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400 mb-6 border border-purple-500/20">
                        <i class="ph-fill ph-code text-2xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-white">Robust Architecture</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Engineered by professionals for 99.99% uptime. Our scalable cloud infrastructure ensures real-time location tracking and instant matching works seamlessly, even during peak festive travel seasons.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How it works -->
    <section class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">How RouteShare Works</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">It only takes a few minutes to set up an account and hit the road.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 relative">
                <!-- Connecting Line (Desktop only) -->
                <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-1/2 left-1/6 right-1/6 h-0.5 bg-slate-200 -translate-y-1/2 z-0" style="width: 66%; left: 16.5%;"></div>

                <!-- Step 1 -->
                <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full shadow-lg border-4 border-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 group-hover:border-brand-500 transition-colors">
                        1
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Search or Post</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 px-4">Enter your departure and arrival points. Drivers post their route, passengers book their seats.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full shadow-lg border-4 border-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 group-hover:border-brand-500 transition-colors">
                        2
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Review & Connect</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 px-4">Check verified profiles, ratings, and vehicle details. Chat securely in-app to coordinate pickup.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full shadow-lg border-4 border-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 group-hover:border-brand-500 transition-colors">
                        3
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Travel Together</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 px-4">Meet at the agreed spot, enjoy the comfortable ride, and save money while making new connections.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 pt-16 pb-8">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-12">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
                        <div class="bg-brand-600 text-white p-1.5 rounded-lg">
                            <i class="ph ph-car-profile text-xl"></i>
                        </div>
                        <span class="font-bold text-xl text-slate-900">RouteShare</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
                        Making intercity travel affordable, eco-friendly, and secure. Built for the modern traveler.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex gap-4">
                        <a href="#" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors"><i class="ph-fill ph-twitter-logo text-2xl"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors"><i class="ph-fill ph-instagram-logo text-2xl"></i></a>
                        <a href="#" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors"><i class="ph-fill ph-linkedin-logo text-2xl"></i></a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Top Routes</h4>
                    <ul class="space-y-3">
                        <li><a href="#" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 text-sm transition-colors">Bangalore &rarr; Mysore</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#" class="text-slate-500 hover:text-brand-600 text-sm transition-colors">Chennai &rarr; Bangalore</a></li>
